title: Start
---
<<declare $prepared = false>>
<<declare $task = "Plan the day">>
Open the activity desk to prepare, or continue to choose your day.
-> Take the station shift
    <<set $task = "Station shift">>
    <<if $prepared>>
    Your prepared kit is ready for the station shift.
    <<else>>
    You start the station shift without a prepared kit.
    <<endif>>
-> Take a rest day
    <<set $task = "Rest day">>
    You take a quiet day at home.
